:30Z","role":"primary","sha256":"e8eb46eaecb4abcbeb921e20b86682116505e944b3bf242a62b0cfb24053b244","supports":["details.benchmark_protocol","notes"],"url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/batechworks/AndroidControl_Curated/955062cc68e20666f71c4930e6025f989393a326/src/eval/utils.py"}],"id":"url:dda8a0f1413a6bc7c26f","identifiers":{},"kind":"benchmark","last_verified_at":"2026-10-18T16:19:08Z","licenses":{"code":null,"data":null,"document":null,"weights":null},"links":[{"rel":"primary","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/batwBMW/AndroidControl_Curated"}],"name":"AndroidControl-Curated","notes":"The Hub repository holds five benchmark JSON files, three screenshot tar.gz archives (about 18 GB in total) and the project's web-page assets; the card declares no data license. The point-format files keep coordinate targets, the bbox files add element boxes, and the high-level task-improved file adds revised task text and corrected labels from the paper's LLM-plus-human review; the evaluation script runs that file by default. The GitHub repository batechworks/AndroidControl_Curated carries JSON files with the same names and the vLLM evaluation code. Archives were not downloaded and scores were not reproduced.","published_at":null,"relations":[{"evidence_url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/batwBMW/AndroidControl_Curated/raw/62aeecdcafa4097d340c5a4389690a5f14e938ed/README.md","target_id":"arxiv:2510.18488","type":"documented_by"}],"review_status":"curated","scope":"core","summary":"Purified AndroidControl test set that scores predicted clicks against target element boxes and repairs ambiguous or wrong task labels, released as step-level JSON files with screenshot archives.","task_classes":["R01.11.01.01"],"topics":["evaluation","mobile-navigation","grounding"],"updated_at":null,"url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/batwBMW/AndroidControl_Curated"}
